      "id": "claim_10e72711bd5a4613b9c0a6879eaafa2f",
      "statement": "The wrapper discovers the Zotero binary by honoring ZOTERO_PLUGIN_ZOTERO_BIN_PATH when set, otherwise taking the first existing zotero.exe among %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Zotero, %ProgramFiles%\\Zotero and %ProgramFiles(x86)%\\Zotero (falling back to the first candidate); --screenshots pre-creates .scaffold/screenshots and injects FLEXANNOTATE_SCREENSHOTS=1 plus FLEXANNOTATE_SCREENSHOT_DIR into the child environment, and --grep sets FLEXANNOTATE_GREP.",
