    {
      "id": "claim_fd3ee0cfed1940478239e2bd841dd274",
      "statement": "npm run test:versions (scripts/run-versions.mjs) targets the installed version read from the Version= line of %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Zotero\\app\\application.ini (Program Files fallbacks, \"installed\" label on read failure) plus every sorted .zotero-versions/<version>/core/zotero.exe, deletes .scaffold/test/profile before every run (the scaffold clears only the data directory; a kept profile carried the previous version's startup cache and extension registry and made runs order-dependent — 8.0.4 failed only directly after 7.0.32), parses passed/failed from the \"Test run completed\" line but counts pending from the \"ℹ … pending\" output lines because Zotero's summary omits skips, prints a version/passed/failed/pending/exit table, and exits 1 when any version failed or produced no result.",
