      "statement": "Subset runs go through FLEXANNOTATE_GREP: the wrapper sets it from --grep, test/helpers.ts reads it at test-file load time and passes it to mocha.grep, so the full title (describe + it) is matched as a substring; run-versions.mjs forwards the pattern to every version run; and for unit tests `node --test --test-name-pattern=<pattern>` must precede the file glob (npm run test:unit -- … would append it after the glob), with direct file selection like `node --test test-unit/persistentRect.test.ts` as the alternative. The named patterns for the persistent-dialog suites are persistent, browse, stored rect, reopen, switch and wide window.",
