      "statement": "Screenshots run only with FLEXANNOTATE_SCREENSHOTS=1 into FLEXANNOTATE_SCREENSHOT_DIR (default .scaffold/test/shots): test/screenshot.ts renders a window or CSS-selected element via the chrome-only CanvasRenderingContext2D.drawWindow and writes a PNG with IOUtils; drawWindow captures only the window itself so popups and menus do not appear even with USE_WIDGET_LAYERS (hence the narrow-window case writes menu-geometry.json for an external capture); npm run screenshots:docs copies the ten curated PNGs from .scaffold/screenshots/ to docs/img/, warns above 250 KB, and exits 1 when the run failed or a curated file is missing.",
